* CAN1 (CAN, page 4): 500 kbit/s on a 10 m bus. Module A (this board, JP1 bridged) transmits; two MES4-MCUs on 0.3 m stubs
* at 3 m and 6 m (JP1 open) and a terminated MES4-MCU at the far end B listen. Each node: U3 input + D1 NUP2105L.
* Cable 120 ohm differential, 5 ns/m, modelled as two 60 ohm lines. Driver stepped typical (VOD 2.0 V) / weakest (1.5 V).
* Bits are 2 us from 1 us: D R D D D D D R D R R R R R (D = dominant). Sample point 87.5 % = 1.75 us into the bit.
.step param Rd list 13.5 38
.include models.inc
V3   v3 0 3.3
Vrec rec 0 3.3
Vtx  txd 0 PWL(0 3.3 1u 3.3 1.01u 0 3u 0 3.01u 3.3 5u 3.3 5.01u 0 15u 0 15.01u 3.3 17u 3.3 17.01u 0 19u 0 19.01u 3.3)
XU3A txd ha la v3 0 HVD230 Rd={Rd}
XD1A ha la 0 NUP2105L
R7A  ha la 120
TAh ha 0 h0 0 Z0=60 Td=0.3n                    ; module + socket + carrier to the bus connector, ~5 cm
TAl la 0 l0 0 Z0=60 Td=0.3n
T1h h0 0 h3 0 Z0=60 Td=15n
T1l l0 0 l3 0 Z0=60 Td=15n
TS1h h3 0 s1h 0 Z0=60 Td=1.5n                  ; 0.3 m stub at 3 m
TS1l l3 0 s1l 0 Z0=60 Td=1.5n
XU3S1 rec s1h s1l v3 0 HVD230 Rd={Rd}
XD1S1 s1h s1l 0 NUP2105L
T2h h3 0 h6 0 Z0=60 Td=15n
T2l l3 0 l6 0 Z0=60 Td=15n
TS2h h6 0 s2h 0 Z0=60 Td=1.5n                  ; 0.3 m stub at 6 m
TS2l l6 0 s2l 0 Z0=60 Td=1.5n
XU3S2 rec s2h s2l v3 0 HVD230 Rd={Rd}
XD1S2 s2h s2l 0 NUP2105L
T3h h6 0 hb 0 Z0=60 Td=20n
T3l l6 0 lb 0 Z0=60 Td=20n
XU3B rec hb lb v3 0 HVD230 Rd={Rd}
XD1B hb lb 0 NUP2105L
R7B  hb lb 120
.tran 0 30u 0 0.2n
.options plotwinsize=0
.save V(txd) V(ha) V(la) V(hb) V(lb) V(s1h) V(s1l)
.meas tran vod_a    FIND V(ha,la) AT 14u
.meas tran vod_b    FIND V(hb,lb) AT 14u
.meas tran vod_s1   FIND V(s1h,s1l) AT 14u
.meas tran vmin_dom_b MIN V(hb,lb) FROM 5.3u TO 15u
.meas tran vmin_dom_s1 MIN V(s1h,s1l) FROM 5.3u TO 15u
.meas tran vmax_rec_b MAX V(hb,lb) FROM 15.3u TO 17u
.meas tran vmax_rec_s1 MAX V(s1h,s1l) FROM 15.3u TO 17u
.meas tran vsp_rec_b FIND V(hb,lb) AT 4.75u
.meas tran t_dom_b  TRIG V(txd) VAL=1.65 FALL=1 TD=4u TARG V(hb,lb) VAL=0.9 RISE=1 TD=5u
.meas tran t_rec_b  TRIG V(txd) VAL=1.65 RISE=1 TD=14u TARG V(hb,lb) VAL=0.5 FALL=1 TD=15u
.end
